Title: Native R Bindings to the Hugging Face Xet Storage Engine
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Andrew", "Brown", , "brown.andrewg@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides R bindings to the Hugging Face Xet content-addressed
